:: Boutique
<<set $bus to "boutiqueshop">>
<div id="clothingShop-div" class="main-shop-div">
	<<luxury_jewelleryShop-main>>
</div>

:: Boutique Widgets [widget]

<<widget "luxury_jewelleryShop-main">>
	<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "boutique">><<effects>>
	<<set $shopName = "luxury_jewellery">>

	You are in the boutique on Danube Street. 
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or $transformationParts.traits.sharpEyes isnot "disabled">>
		<<if $fame.social gte 1000 + $fame.business gte 1000 gte 2000>>
			The security doesn't pay you much mind.
		<<elseif $fame.social gte 1000 + $fame.business gte 1000 gte 1000>>
			You catch the bodyguard's gaze following you from time to time.
		<<else>>
			Watchful eyes of the security follow your every step. You aren't the usual customer.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $fame.social gte 1000 + $fame.business gte 1000 gte 2000>>
			You don't catch any security around you.
		<<elseif $fame.social gte 1000 + $fame.business gte 1000 gte 1000>>
			You don't catch any security around you, but some customer's gaze follows you from time to time.
		<<else>>
			You feel watched, but you aren't sure by whom.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>


	<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>

		<<passoutshop>>
	<<else>>
		<<if Time.hour is $closinghour>>
			It's closing time. Security is herding everyone outside. <<if $exposed gte 1>>Panic swells within you as you realise how exposed you'll be should security find you in this state of dress.<</if>>
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			<<if $openinghours is 0>>
				You are alone in the darkness.
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
				<div id="tryonstats-div"><<tryOnStats>></div>
				<<unset $shopListStartCount>>
				<<unset $clothes_choice>>
				<<set $shopPage = 0>>

				<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
					You are alone in the darkness.
				<</if>>
				
				<br>
				<<clothingcategoryicon "all">>
				<<link "View All">><<replace "#clothingShop-div">><<AllShop>><</replace>><</link>>
				<br><br>
				<<clothingcategoryicon "neck">>
				<<link "View Neck Accessories">><<replace "#clothingShop-div">><<NeckShop>><</replace>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<clothingcategoryicon "earrings">>
				<<link "View Earrings">><<replace "#clothingShop-div">><<EarringsShop>><</replace>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<clothingcategoryicon "rings">>
				<<link "View Rings">><<replace "#clothingShop-div">><<RingsShop>><</replace>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<clothingcategoryicon "hand">>
				<<link "View Hand Accessories">><<replace "#clothingShop-div">><<HandsShop>><</replace>><</link>>
				<br>
				<br><br>
				<<run linkifyDivs('.button-back-to-shop')>>

				<<if Time.dayState is "night" and Time.hour isnot $closinghour and !$weekly.theft.boutique>>
					<<shopicon "register">><<link [[Examine the cash register|Boutique Register]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
		<</if>>
			<<if Time.dayState is "night" or $tryOn.value is 0>>
				<<if $tryOn.value gt 0 and Object.values(V.tryOn?.tryingOn).some(slot => slot?.type.includes("heavy"))>>
					<span class="red">The jewellery you're trying on is too heavy to steal!</span>
				<<elseif Time.dayState is "night" and $clothingShop.stolenClothes gt 0>>
					You see the security outside the door. <span class="red">There is no chance to slip by them.</span>
				<<else>>
					<<getouticon>>
					<<link [[Leave|Danube Street]]>>
						<<shopClothingFilterReset>>
						<<ShowUnderEquip "normal">>
						<<ShowUnderEquip "over">>
						<<buyTryOnClothes "wear" "steal">>
						<<set $tryOn.autoReset to true>>
						<<shopHoodCheck>>
						<<shopCommandoCheck>>
					<</link>>
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
			<<elseif $tryOn.value isnot 0>>
				<<icon "hanger.png">><<link "Return jewellery">><<clothingReset>>
					<<updatesidebarimg>>
					<<updatesidebardescription>>
					<<updateallure>>
					<<updateclothingshop>>
					<<run updateMoment()>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
				<<if $tryOn.value gt 0 and $tryOn.value lte $money>>
					<<sendItemsToDropdown>>
					<<highicon>><<link "Buy jewellery">><<buyTryOnClothes "wear">><<updatesidebarmoney>><<updateclothingshop>><</link>>
					<br>
					<<wardrobeicon>><<link "Buy jewellery and send to wardrobe">>
						<<buyTryOnClothes "wardrobe">>
						<<updatesidebarmoney>>
						<<updatesidebarimg>>
						<<updatesidebardescription>>
						<<updateallure>>
						<<updateclothingshop>>
						<<run updateMoment()>>
					<</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
				<<if $tryOn.value gt 0>>
					<<if Object.values(V.tryOn.tryingOn).some(slot => slot?.type.includes("heavy"))>>
						<span class="red">The jewellery you're trying on is too heavy to steal!</span>
					<<else>>
						<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave with stolen jewellery|Stolen Jewellery Boutique Result]]>><<shopClothingFilterReset>><<shopHoodCheck>><<shopCommandoCheck>><</link>><<crime "thievery">>
					<</if>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Stolen Jewellery Boutique Result
<<effects>>
<<ShowUnderEquip "over">>
<<ShowUnderEquip "normal">>

A few security guard watch you entrance closely as you approach the door. Realizing there is no way to slip past them, you leave the stollen jewellery behind.
<<clothingReset>>

<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><<set $tryOn.autoReset to true>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Boutique Guard

<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
The boutique is closed. <<openinghours>> Two security guards stand in from of the entrance, watching it closely. There is no chance for you to sneak in.
<br><br>

<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Danube Street]]>><<handheldon>><</link>>